proposed.construction:
For \(r\in\mathcal R_{n,3}\), define
\[
\begin{aligned}
D^{\mathrm A}_{r,x}
&=\sum_{m\in\mathcal M_{n,3}}
 \nu_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(m)
 P_m(x^{\mathrm{obs}}\mid r),\\
N^{\mathrm A}_{r,x}
&=\sum_{m\in\mathcal M_{n,3}}
 \nu_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(m)
 P_m(x^{\mathrm{obs}}\mid r)\tau_{c^\dagger}(m),\\
\mathcal B_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(r)
&=\sum_m\nu_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(m)
 \tau_{c^\dagger}(m)^2
 -\sum_{x^{\mathrm{obs}}:D^{\mathrm A}_{r,x}>0}
 \frac{(N^{\mathrm A}_{r,x})^2}{D^{\mathrm A}_{r,x}}.
\end{aligned}
\]
Set
\[
B_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}
=\min_{r\in\mathcal R_{n,3}}
 \mathcal B_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(r),
\qquad
G_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(r)
=n^{4/3}\left\{n^{-1}
 -\mathcal B_{n,k,\varepsilon}^{\dagger,\mathrm A}(r)\right\}.
\]
